          "itemId": "1:202600273-ZC-S-PUD-MSP-PR-HD-ALT",
          "title": "A zoning ordinance map amendment to rezone approximately 568.312 acres from the Rural Residential (RR) District to the Rural Urban Transition (RUT) District and a preliminary plat of 175 lots consisting of 117 residential lots, 11 vineyard lots, and 47 common lots for Bellarossa Subdivision. The applicant has also applied for a Planned Unit Development, Master Site Plan, Private Road, Hillside Development, and Alternative Compliance. There is also a Development Agreement Modification (Project #202400171 DA-DM). The property is generally located northeast of the intersection of Willow Creek Rd and Stillwell Dr and contains approximately 588.6 acres; Sections 27, 28, 29, and 33, T.5N, R.1E. Brent Danielson, Senior Planner, at either (208) 287-7913 or bdanielson@adacounty.id.gov. Tabled from September 10th, 2026",
